<%# The `wallet` size: one Letter page, four identical 3.5x4in fold-strips
    (2 across x 2 down), cut apart and folded once each. Printed single-sided
    — Grover's margin is 0 for this size, same as `half`, and the CSS below
    lays the 2x2 grid out against the full untrimmed page.

    :care_only is not offered at this size — see the class comment on
    Communicators::GenerateCarePlan. Content is always the combined plan's
    condensed day-to-day lines (Communicators::GenerateCarePlan::WALLET_LINE_LIMIT),
    never the overflow ladder the `half` size has: there is no room here for
    anything but the hard cap. %>

<div class="wallet-sheet">
  <div class="wallet-page">
    <% 4.times do %>
      <%= render "communicators/assets/care_plan_wallet_strip" %>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <div class="wallet-legend">
    <span class="keyline"><i></i> <%= t("care.document.wallet.legend_cut") %></span>
    <span class="keyline"><i class="dash"></i> <%= t("care.document.wallet.legend_fold") %></span>
  </div>
</div>
